Lojgloss is not "jbogloss", but since I get the vague sense that the
name "Lojgloss" is somewhat distasteful to some of you, and since I
didn't really like the name "Lojgloss" anyway, I'm making the official
lojbanic name of Lojgloss be "la tavycpi" (i.e. "the parrot"), unless
someone objects to my lujvo. This way, you can refer to in in Lojban
if you like, and you can refer to it lojbanically in English, if you
like. The official English name remains "Lojgloss", as I'm too lazy to
change it.

